    "show_share": true,
    "description": "After more than 15 years at a Kenyan media house, NTV, Mark Masai knew media inside out. But stepping into a PR agency as Director showed him something he hadn't anticipated: there was an entire dimension of communications he'd only scratched the surface of. Strategic Communications wasn't just another specialty. It was deeper than he'd realised. More rigorous and he wanted to understand it properly.",
